<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index closes down.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index closes down.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Tuesday closed 0.12 percent lower in higher trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 605.67 from 606.44 on Monday. Trading volume was 2.547 million dinars against 2.174 million dinars.</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
</text>
